@ Index:    Bundled engineering settings
@ Author:   Jaco Mostert
@ Source:   AN0015
@ Source:   https://forum.swissmicros.com/viewtopic.php?p=33113#p33113
@ Created:  2024-08-01
@ Modified: 2026-01-25
@ Tested:   Sets IRFRAC, DENANY and eRPN
@ Input:    Those three cleared
@ Output:   All three set to 1
LBL ‘SETT’
  setEUR
  RWDOT⋅
  MULT·
  CPX𝒿
  CF ‘CPXmul’
  CF ‘CONV_(HP)’
  FDIGS 31
  CF ‘FRCYC’
  SF ‘IRFRAC’
  SF ‘PROPFR’
  SF ‘DENANY’
  CF ‘DENFIX’
  DMX 12
  SIG 03
  ENGOVR
  HIDE 31
  RNG 6143
  SF ‘dℤ.0’
  CF ‘dLrgLI’
  CF ‘RP_(HP)’
  SF ‘eRPN’
  SSIZE8
  SF ‘CPXRES’
  SF ‘SPCRES’
  CF ‘1024ⁿ’
  END
.END.
